menu "FMS: duong HTTP (uplink)"

config UPLINK_HTTP_ENABLE
    bool "Bat duong HTTP len edge_collector (/node/v1/*)"
    default y
    help
      Duong truyen goc: node tu POST so do, tu GET lenh moi 2 giay.

      TAT di thi ca uplink.c bien mat khoi anh nap — khong con
      esp_http_client, khong con bo dem 4 KB, khong con ngan xep 8 KB.
      Khi do mqtt_link phai gach het cong viec:

        - phat so do: doc THANG tu spooler va ack theo PUBACK
          (che do tap chi dung khi HTTP con bat)
        - nhan lenh: dang ky <goc>/<serial>/cmd
        - den bao suc khoe: uplink_server_ok() tra ve trang thai broker

      Dieu kien bat buoc truoc khi tat: consumer ben edge phai chay o che
      do DAY (EDGE_MQTT_CONSUMER_FORWARD=true). Tat HTTP trong khi consumer
      con o che do bong thi khong con duong nao toi Odoo — day chuyen toi.

endmenu
